==Faroese==
{{fo-decl-adj-16|g|ó|o}}
===Etymology===
From {{ON.|fo}} ''[[góðr]]''.

===Adjective===
'''góður'''

# [[good]]

====Antonyms====
*[[ringur]], [[illur]] (bad)

====Usage notes====
*{{m}} [[ein]] '''góður''' [[dagur]] - a good day
*{{f}} [[ein]] '''góð''' [[bók]] - a good book
*{{n}} [[eitt]] '''gott''' [[verk]] - a good work

====Phrases====
*[[góðan morgun]] - good morning
*[[góðan dag]] - good day
*[[gott kvøld]] - good evening
*[[góða nátt]] - good night
*'''góða''' [[ólavsøka|ólavsøku]] - good St. Olav's Day

